    "policy_id": "POL-DUP-01",
    "title": "Duplicate charge reversal",
    "text": "A charge that appears twice for the same amount within three days is a duplicate. The duplicated amount is refunded in full, up to 5000 USD, if the duplicate invoice is at most 60 days old. The duplicate must be visible in the customer's invoice history.",
